<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-24T23:34:15.903Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:34:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli air strikes have killed senior Hamas security officials in Gaza, while Israeli forces have cut $90 million from border community recovery budgets to fund defense and detained a Polish lawmaker ahead of a West Bank visit. Gaza health officials have issued an alert over a rising meningitis epidemic, and a night of arson has been linked to Israeli Jewish terrorism. Israel's top court described West Bank settlers as acting like militias, and the United Nations warned that the war has undone 77 years of human development in Gaza. The conflict has produced 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6rrg7ggq190o?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/news/audio/2026/nov/24/myanmar-found-guilty-genocide-should-israel-be-worried-podcast&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168862&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPay0yd3Uza29STzRjVUJyMkdYQ21jRUY4SjA1MnZ4cGExdkNGeEEya2RoY0dkbDNlZV9iSzVOQlpoLUxyWFFxUjRINWt5dnd3NTZpR0YySURVZWhmOWtDeVU5WlNuZFdPYzNzdko0X0ZTbjFySEl5eXhjSkZrUlVZdWpFaHpKX0RLNUpUSzNJcnFob1BNWFNGeko5UzA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxQTm4zT3d4YU5BT09VbjFlVEh1SF9CS29pX0JLTjZ4blZ2V1hDdXRFOVlaU2JFVzNObEh3U3NJem8zcVp2aXFSdVpHN3NXS2pVb0ZWYUVrRnNFT29mVTFGZWp5YWJzbm9lc09YMGJiMGRqNzNYRno4T3MycWRTUEZ1M25B?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href